Some pages set a size of zero and size their images by CSS.
-- input.html --
<body><img src="/a.png" width="0" height="0"></body>
-- want.html --
<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><title></title>
<link rel="canonical" href="http://example.com/"/></head>
<body data-id="0"><img src="http://example.com/a.png" data-id="1"/></body></html>
